paperweight-fonts (0.1.1-1) trixie; urgency=low

  * Add fonts-symbola dependency: covers Unicode Miscellaneous Technical
    block (U+2300–U+23FF), which Nerd Fonts omit. Required for correct
    rendering of mode indicator glyphs in Claude Code and similar tools.
  * Update package description to document fonts-symbola inclusion.

 -- Alex Long <johnalexanderlong@gmail.com>  Wed, 17 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000

paperweight-fonts (0.1.0-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial packaging: JetBrains Mono Nerd Font (Regular, Bold, Italic,
    BoldItalic, Medium, SemiBold, Mono variants) and Symbols Nerd Font.
    Sourced from ryanoasis/nerd-fonts v3 releases under SIL OFL 1.1.

